  [1mGENERATE[0m

  Generates starter application in APEXlang format.

  Usage:

    [33mgenerate[0m|[33mgen[0m {OPTIONS}

  Options:

    [33m-dir[0m|[33m-di[0m <dir> {PATH}
    The directory to generate starter application files

    [33m-workspaceid[0m|[33m-woi[0m <workspaceid> {INTEGER}
    Specify the workspace id which will retrieve the workspace name to be put in
    the generated default deployment file

    [33m-workspace[0m|[33m-ws[0m <workspace>
    The workspace name used for generate, validate or import commands if
    multiple workspaces are available with current connection. If workspace id
    option is also provided, that value will be used instead of this option.

    [33m-id[0m|[33m-id[0m <id> {INTEGER}
    Specify the application id that will be put in the generated default
