    [33m-name[0m|[33m-n[0m <name>
    Specify the application name that will be used in the generated application
    files instead of the default

    [33m-alias[0m|[33m-al[0m <alias>
    Specify the application alias that will be used in the generated application
    files instead of the default

    [33m-schema[0m|[33m-sch[0m <schema>
